  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thailand Police Reform and ASEAN Regional Correctional Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK will assist the Royal Thai Police with the improvement of police detention process and other related matters, such as internal investigations. Activities include a visit to the UK by RTP leadership and several visits to Thailand by Home Office experts and Northumbria police. 2. ASEAN Regional Correctional Conference (ARCC) &#x2013; the UK will provide continued support to the growth and development of ASEAN Correctional Services collaboration through UK financial and technical assistance to ARCC3 hosted by Thailand in February 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
